# Gradle & Dependencies

- **Do not modify build.gradle / build.gradle.kts** unless explicitly requested.
- Assume Paper API is **compileOnly** (provided-scope equivalent).
- **Never shade or relocate** Paper/Bukkit APIs.
- Ensure all code compiles under the existing Gradle configuration.
